{
"file": 2,
"paths": [
"d002/f583"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "ec021fa3",
"en_raw": "Those Toilet Gang punks"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "b28be376",
"en_raw": "They really tick me off"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "0c7329c9",
"en_raw": "Of all the things to say"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "84c8bf97",
"en_raw": "'Your house is cursed,' they said"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "1cc4ca4d",
"en_raw": "That's the estate photo thing, right?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "eb2e96fa",
"en_raw": "I heard a bit about it too"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a0589ff2",
"en_raw": "...A photo of the estate? What's that?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "e609bb1d",
"en_raw": "You know, that"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "91867377",
"en_raw": "The photo in the city newsletter"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b67d2f6c",
"en_raw": "of Hirumidai housing estate"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0cd40f43",
"en_raw": "on the concrete wall of Building 4"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "51af981c",
"en_raw": "there's a shadow like a person"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "5fc67d10",
"en_raw": "...Don't tell me"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "93b1eef8",
"en_raw": "That's all?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "589ea771",
"en_raw": "How stupid"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "43dddc42",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "cba0f4c7",
"en_raw": "Oh well"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "37008609",
"en_raw": "Still, we never notice what's closest"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a318ec77",
"en_raw": "Right under our noses"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "130aef37",
"en_raw": "there was a rumor like that"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "f52c478f",
"en_raw": "I'm going to go look at the estate wall"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "e840dc8f",
"en_raw": "So we're going to Sango's today?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "353b5ed2",
"en_raw": "Yay!"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5f1c2b81",
"en_raw": "Sango's house!"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "6115d301",
"en_raw": "Just so you know"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "2ca9cd0d",
"en_raw": "I'm not letting you in my room"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "956fdbf0",
"en_raw": "Building 4's wall, but"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "fb4bf350",
"en_raw": "which side's wall, I wonder..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "4d3c08a1",
"en_raw": "If we check the city newsletter"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "2334b62e",
"en_raw": "we'd know right away, wouldn't we?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "0cf1d906",
"en_raw": "Things like that"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "267e056f",
"en_raw": "you see all the time"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "879464e6",
"en_raw": "when you don't care"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b1d1decf",
"en_raw": "but when you actually look, huh..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "fa8eb9e0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "a7adda2f",
"en_raw": "Tell me something"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "c39c7efb",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "66081959",
"en_raw": "Where was the ghost in that photo?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f4fd6aca",
"en_raw": "...Hmm"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "9185555a",
"en_raw": "The cloud part, somehow..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "e02fe2e9",
"en_raw": "Are you making fun of me?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "10c17a14",
"en_raw": "is what I want to ask"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "8f8d9586",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "b3aefcd1",
"en_raw": "When are we going to Sango's?"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "c1bd1356",
"en_raw": "We're not going"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "31bb900d",
"en_raw": "Then what's that thing"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "760d4674",
"en_raw": "falling by Sango's house?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "59b3ce66",
"en_raw": "Who knows, just a coincidence?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "c0bbd78a",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I'm not convinced"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "5b77ed8d",
"en_raw": "Sangoooo!"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "8dc32b1f",
"en_raw": "I don't know what I don't know!"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "dc337b18",
"en_raw": "If you're so curious, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "5bc965af",
"en_raw": "look into it yourself"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b3aefcd1",
"en_raw": "When are we going to Sango's?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "28ee8381",
"en_raw": "I'm not going, I said"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "34496ce7",
"en_raw": "Did you ask where the notice board is?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "53928e62",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, then"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "379a5f30",
"en_raw": "what's that thing falling, whoosh?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ca01afed",
"en_raw": "No use expecting anything from Shiina"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "24cc564d",
"en_raw": "Listen, I'm local, so I'll look into it"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "1fd73cb5",
"en_raw": "Sango, do you believe in spirit photos?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "a2bf04aa",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "a85b1b04",
"en_raw": "I mean, like"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "dbcd754b",
"en_raw": "things you normally can't see"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "5acb681d",
"en_raw": "showing up in a photo by chance..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "3227d891",
"en_raw": "Sure, they're not pleasant, but"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "0415a8b3",
"en_raw": "curses and stuff..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "e71d7f33",
"en_raw": "You don't believe in ghosts either, right?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "69513a1e",
"en_raw": "I mean"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "9c6fae7f",
"en_raw": "Being scared of every single one of those"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "cd5517fd",
"en_raw": "takes more free time"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "b99c529d",
"en_raw": "than my life has, you know"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "e9b53a73",
"en_raw": "Then"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "1b031e74",
"en_raw": "this rumor's over now"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "e9c29672",
"en_raw": "No, the 'floating spirit' is left"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "e5ee33dd",
"en_raw": "It's all made up"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "010148b4",
"en_raw": "Sango, that girl"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "dfaeac38",
"en_raw": "doesn't like you, does she?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "f5a9f7ad",
"en_raw": "When I deny something"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "577767a0",
"en_raw": "I do it thoroughly"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "8cb44e6d",
"en_raw": "That's my style"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "10a20459",
"en_raw": "...Hey, hey"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "277a16b6",
"en_raw": "When are we going to Sango's?"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "1bacdd94",
"en_raw": "Shut up!"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "1b3d6ad0",
"en_raw": "Just as expected, or"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "880ca63c",
"en_raw": "whatever"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "5819cba6",
"en_raw": "Nothing rumor-worthy"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "c5441ed2",
"en_raw": "...Feels kind of refreshing"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "ddf7a0a9",
"en_raw": "But come to think of it, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "0724f638",
"en_raw": "said something, didn't she?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "f0aa8b06",
"en_raw": "About something falling or whatever..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "95c57180",
"en_raw": "Oh, that's right"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "53fa2ff5",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what was that?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "16934165",
"en_raw": "...Dunno"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "4ee4eeec",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's hurry to Sango's"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "6bbe76b4",
"en_raw": "I want to go!"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "a2df99ac",
"en_raw": "Something's bugging me..."
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "b5914a79",
"en_raw": "Let's stop, Sango"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "9004c600",
"en_raw": "What, you too, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "0e85aab0",
"en_raw": "Now I can't stop even more"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "437b0a62",
"en_raw": "Falling down... huh"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "c941b1d5",
"en_raw": "The caretaker's always around there"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "16d9e8c9",
"en_raw": "Maybe he knows something...?"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "8994c800",
"en_raw": "I thought the caretaker was just"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "9c147141",
"en_raw": "a nag, but"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "9c5823b4",
"en_raw": "he's pretty interesting"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "9c0d579d",
"en_raw": "'You get old and die anyway' - true"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "e30f39d1",
"en_raw": "I feel kind of refreshed"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "d7e1e0b2",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "4ea529bb",
"en_raw": "Why the weird face?"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "252a9260",
"en_raw": "Mm..."
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "b4e50c6e",
"en_raw": "Yeah, just..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "019fafb1",
"en_raw": "...Weird"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "ae17f688",
"en_raw": "'You get old and die anyway'..."
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "e12dfd3e",
"en_raw": "Ha ha, great line"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "3868533a",
"en_raw": "We learned how the curse came about"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "bcaede3c",
"en_raw": "so this one's neatly solved"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "b25c10fa",
"en_raw": "...You think so?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "c7b03d6c",
"en_raw": "Got a problem?"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "73937200",
"en_raw": "Hey Sango, the caretaker"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "acc94e0f",
"en_raw": "was talking about the mound behind school"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "e363654f",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "f55968ef",
"en_raw": "Oh..."
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "63308ee0",
"en_raw": "Came to the estate once 13 years ago"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "f771d5b7",
"en_raw": "and then got moved there, right"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "fb61c4c2",
"en_raw": "Yeah, but he never said"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "023b2984",
"en_raw": "the important part"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "e172b8d6",
"en_raw": "The important part?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "bb18b16e",
"en_raw": "I mean, that mound"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "299c8cb4",
"en_raw": "where did it come from?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "0628e7a2",
"en_raw": "Where the mound was originally..."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "62400323",
"en_raw": "I mean, to begin with"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "9d907efb",
"en_raw": "there's no such thing as a mound curse!"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "1da6b71c",
"en_raw": "Maybe, but"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "693dce1d",
"en_raw": "it bothers you?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "48303fd8",
"en_raw": "Well, I guess..."
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "3f7605d9",
"en_raw": "What if someone said it used to be"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "4c322a02",
"en_raw": "under Nao's house?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "0ed3787f",
"en_raw": "Stop it"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "15577b1b",
"en_raw": "Ha ha ha"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "6441537e",
"en_raw": "Nao is such a scaredy-cat"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "860085de",
"en_raw": "If you want, you could"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "01a705b2",
"en_raw": "just ask again"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "8befdb56",
"en_raw": "that caretaker"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "64d9d55b",
"en_raw": "I bet he knows everything"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7fe47d98",
"en_raw": "...Aww, Kurumi is bored"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "abcbfec8",
"en_raw": "If you're that curious"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "fee22c44",
"en_raw": "go ask the caretaker"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "a7767e43",
"en_raw": "That man knows everything"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "f42fe55c",
"en_raw": "about the estate"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "488b31cd",
"en_raw": "As far as I know"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "e41770c0",
"en_raw": "he's always been the same guy"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "e21a4601",
"en_raw": "What are you thinking, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "c311a3f8",
"en_raw": "Because of us"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "adf20650",
"en_raw": "nobody's going to die"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "8d662dd3",
"en_raw": "And what's more"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "f95c04d6",
"en_raw": "it's not a floating spirit's doing either"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "2a1a864e",
"en_raw": "My grandpa was even"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "78871bdc",
"en_raw": "younger than that, but"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "65b1d836",
"en_raw": "he died too"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "26f2f51f",
"en_raw": "It's just normal, everyday life"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "420245e6",
"en_raw": "I know"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "7cd4c2d5",
"en_raw": "I know, but..."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "537df2a7",
"en_raw": "Why do you always want to"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "144178a7",
"en_raw": "overcomplicate things?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "41622121",
"en_raw": "If it's about the Bird Mound"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "daaa870f",
"en_raw": "just ask the neighbors"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "66f12641",
"en_raw": "At least one person knows"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "10a1348f",
"en_raw": "I'm sure"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "d7e1e0b2",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "65e4061c",
"en_raw": "The Bird Mound's location, right?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "2576ed74",
"en_raw": "Ask someone at the estate"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "b8ec45f3",
"en_raw": "Don't make that face"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "3a4cb7f7",
"en_raw": "This is boring"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "b7680dcb",
"en_raw": "It's all a product of coincidence"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "ec25b80c",
"en_raw": "The Bird Mound was really a Crow Mound"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "d1aae563",
"en_raw": "A crow with a human face"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "06b55fca",
"en_raw": "supposedly appears there, or"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "280284a3",
"en_raw": "Or that whoever sees it dies"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "fb0c20d2",
"en_raw": "Or that right after the Bird Mound moved"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "005d1570",
"en_raw": "someone died"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "fd8ca4ee",
"en_raw": "Or that right after we talked about it"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "f96c7b8a",
"en_raw": "the caretaker dies"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "975f05d8",
"en_raw": "Each of those"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "b3f0a0de",
"en_raw": "just happened separately"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "82fbba61",
"en_raw": "And then people go and call it a curse"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "769dc252",
"en_raw": "and stick meaning onto it"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "46c98473",
"en_raw": "and end up like the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "a9f56b38",
"en_raw": "turning it into a religion"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "19374473",
"en_raw": "So stupid..."
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "7e321b53",
"en_raw": "...In the end, it's all"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "41ce5b74",
"en_raw": "the mound's curse's fault..."
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "3e87fad2",
"en_raw": "A rumor like that appearing"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "826e9d40",
"en_raw": "is only a matter of time"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "00c9c8d5",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "a6ac4552",
"en_raw": "But getting any more involved in"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "f92a31d3",
"en_raw": "this rumor is a bad idea, I think"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "a3ff2f33",
"en_raw": "...Because of the caretaker too"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "272c3547",
"en_raw": "...A reasonable answer, I guess"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "d152beea",
"en_raw": "(Because Sango doesn't know anything)"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "e09b3a35",
"en_raw": "(What I saw in that forest...)"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "e970826b",
"en_raw": "(The voice I heard that night...)"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "82d9fa2a",
